{"id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:strongly-measurable-function","title":"def:strongly-measurable-function","path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE.md","line":222,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE.tex#def:strongly-measurable-function","uses":["[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:simple-function-banach-valued]]","[[references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:almost-everywhere]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE.tex","label":"def:strongly-measurable-function","line":343,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Strongly measurable function]\n\\label{def:strongly-measurable-function}\n\\uses{def:simple-function-banach-valued, def:almost-everywhere}\n\\dcref{appE:E.5-def-2}\n\\group{Vector-Valued Integration}\n\nA function $f:[0,T]\\to X$ is strongly measurable if simple functions\n$s_k:[0,T]\\to X$ exist such that\n\\[\ns_k(t)\\to f(t)\\quad\\text{for a.e. }t\\in[0,T].\n\\]\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Strongly measurable function] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a7374726f6e676c792d6d656173757261626c652d66756e6374696f6e\"></span> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixE%23def%3Asimple-function-banach-valued\">↗ def:simple-function-banach-valued</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FEvans%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FappendixE%23def%3Aalmost-everywhere\">↗ def:almost-everywhere</a> <span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. appE:E.5-def-2</span></span>\\group Vector-Valued Integration <p></p>A function <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$f:[0,T]\\to X$\">$f:[0,T]\\to X$</span> is strongly measurable if simple functions <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$s_k:[0,T]\\to X$\">$s_k:[0,T]\\to X$</span> exist such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[  s_k(t)\\to f(t)\\quad \\text{for a.e. }t\\in [0,T].  \\]\">\\[  s_k(t)\\to f(t)\\quad \\text{for a.e. }t\\in [0,T].  \\]</span> ","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: group"]},"previous":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:simple-function-banach-valued","next":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:weakly-measurable-function","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:simple-function-banach-valued","title":"def:simple-function-banach-valued","label":"def:simple-function-banach-valued"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:almost-everywhere","title":"def:almost-everywhere","label":"def:almost-everywhere"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#thm:pettis-theorem","title":"thm:pettis-theorem","label":"thm:pettis-theorem"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#thm:bochner-theorem","title":"thm:bochner-theorem","label":"thm:bochner-theorem"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE#def:strongly-measurable-function","title":"def:strongly-measurable-function","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Strongly measurable function]\n\\label{def:strongly-measurable-function}\n\\uses{def:simple-function-banach-valued, def:almost-everywhere}\n\\dcref{appE:E.5-def-2}\n\\group{Vector-Valued Integration}\n\nA function $f:[0,T]\\to X$ is strongly measurable if simple functions\n$s_k:[0,T]\\to X$ exist such that\n\\[\ns_k(t)\\to f(t)\\quad\\text{for a.e. }t\\in[0,T].\n\\]\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/Evans/blueprint/src/chapters/appendixE.tex","desc